{"v":1,"name":"Priya & Sam","template":"wedding","theme":{"preset":"editorial","mode":"light","colors":{"bg":"#F7F2EA","ink":"#3B3A30","muted":"#6E6B5C","card":"#EDE8E1","line":"#DCD2C2","accent":"#7A8C5C"},"fonts":{"display":"Instrument Serif","body":"System serif"},"radius":4,"base":"light","space":"normal"},"pages":[{"id":"p97671jbl","slug":"index","title":"Home","blocks":[{"id":"b97671d1g","type":"hero","variant":"center","props":{"eyebrow":"Saturday, June 13, 2027","title":"Priya & Sam","text":"Hollow Creek Farm, Hudson Valley, NY. We're getting married in the orchard where we had our first picnic. Come for the ceremony, stay for the dancing, and please bring shoes you can walk on grass in.","img":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","alt":"The venue","shape":"","buttons":[{"label":"RSVP","link":{"kind":"section","to":"contact"}},{"label":"Schedule","link":{"kind":"section","to":"list"}}]}},{"id":"b97671eor","type":"list","variant":"rows","props":{"title":"The day","items":[{"title":"Ceremony","meta":"3:30 pm","text":"The orchard"},{"title":"Drinks and lawn games","meta":"4:30 pm","text":"The big barn porch"},{"title":"Dinner","meta":"6:00 pm","text":"Long tables in the barn"},{"title":"Dancing until late","meta":"8:00 pm","text":"The barn"}]}},{"id":"b97671fgy","type":"features","variant":"grid","props":{"title":"Getting there","items":[{"title":"Getting there","text":"Two hours from the city by car, or the train to Hudson and a 15-minute shuttle we'll run every half hour from 2pm."},{"title":"Where to stay","text":"We've held rooms at The Wren Inn and the Hudson Lodge until May 1. Mention our names when you book."},{"title":"What to wear","text":"Garden party. It gets cool after sunset, so bring a layer."}]}},{"id":"b97671gez","type":"faq","variant":"list","props":{"title":"Questions","items":[{"q":"Can I bring a plus-one?","a":"If your invitation says so, yes. We're keeping it small, thank you for understanding."},{"q":"Are kids welcome?","a":"Yes, there'll be a kid